n GPI-T complex assembly in the luminal layer (PubMed:35165458, PubMed:35551457). Binds GPI-anchor (PubMed:37684232)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}